HR service","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery/configure-hr-service.md","line":84},{"title":"Properties for Employee Document Management application","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/employee-document-management/employee-doc-properties.md","line":108},{"title":"Create or modify an employee document","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/employee-document-management/hr-doc-management-admin.md","line":229},{"title":"Case Management","target":"case-management-workspace","line":233},{"title":"Define policies for a document type","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/employee-document-management/hr-doc-management-config.md","line":249},{"title":"Configure an HR service","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/hr-service-delivery/configure-hr-service.md","line":258},{"title":"HR Administration","target":"c_AdministerHRServiceManagement","line":296},{"title":"Add or remove a legal hold for employee documents","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/employee-document-management/hr-doc-management-admin.md","line":371},{"title":"Properties for Employee Document Management application","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/employee-document-management/employee-doc-properties.md","line":402},{"title":"Properties for Employee Document Management Application","target":"employee-doc-properties","line":408},{"title":"Employee Document Management","target":"hr-employee-doc-management","line":412},{"title":"HR Service Delivery","target":"hr-service-delivery","line":413},{"title":"HR Profile","target":"c_HRProfileRecords","line":414},{"title":"HR services","target":"hr-service-administration","line":415},{"title":"Employee Center","target":"employee-center-landing-page","line":416},{"title":"Case management","target":"case-management-workspace","line":417},{"title":"HR Administration","target":"c_AdministerHRServiceManagement","line":418},{"title":"Properties for Employee Document Management application","target":"employee-doc-properties","line":419}],"metadata":{"title":"Managing employee documents","description":"Use Employee Document Management to search, create, move, or manage legal holds on employee documents.Search for and view employee documents using different filters from the employee document repository. You can also download documents for audit purposes.With the employee document writer \\[sn\\_hr\\_ef.document\\_writer\\] role, you can create or upload an employee document directly to the employee document management repository.You can move employee documents from an HR case to the employee document repository. You can also move employee documents automatically by HR service when an HR case is closed complete.Legal or litigation holds prevent the deletion of documents related to a document type or all employee documents for an HR profile.Add legal hold to multiple HR profiles at one time. Legal or litigation holds prevent the deletion of employee documents for an HR profile.Add legal hold to multiple document types at one time. Legal or litigation holds prevent the deletion of documents related to a document type.You can view a list of all document types or HR profiles that are currently under or had been under a legal hold. You can review the reasons a document type or HR profile was placed on legal hold and remove the legal hold.For optimal system performance and depending on your internal processes, employee documentation is purged based on the security policy established by your company.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/employee-service-management/employee-document-management/hr-doc-management-admin.html","release":"australia","product":"Employee Document Management","classification":"employee-document-management","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":11,"breadcrumb":["Use","Employee Document Management","HR Documents","HR Service Delivery","Employee Service Management"],"tags":["#employee-service-management","#documents","#storage","#classification","#hr","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/employee-service-management/employee-document-management/hr-doc-management-admin.md"},
